<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: electromagnetic reactive plating -->
  <DMS_Hediff_ERAPlating.label>電磁反應裝甲</DMS_Hediff_ERAPlating.label>
  <!-- EN: An add-on array of electromagnetic reactive armor bricks bolted over the chassis. When a shaped charge jet or a heavy explosive hit lands, the brick above it detonates outward and defeats the penetrator entirely, at the cost of being consumed and shocking the frame underneath.\n\nIt does nothing against small arms or melee — those are the job of the base plating. Spent bricks must be replenished with steel. -->
  <DMS_Hediff_ERAPlating.description>一組栓固在底盤外的電磁反應裝甲磚陣列。當成形裝藥射流或重型爆炸物命中時，對應位置的裝甲磚會向外引爆，徹底抵銷穿甲體，代價是該磚塊被消耗殆盡，並對底下的機體造成電擊。\n\n它對輕武器與近戰毫無作用——那是基礎裝甲的工作。耗盡的裝甲磚必須以鋼鐵補充。</DMS_Hediff_ERAPlating.description>
  
</LanguageData>
